~ rival_intro
$> Cutscene.lock_player()
Rival: There you are. I've been training. Have you?
$> Story.start_battle("rival_01")
if Story.last_battle_won()
	$> Story.set_flag("rival_1_done")
	Rival: ...Tch. The road's closed anyway. Next time, then.
$> Cutscene.unlock_player()
=> END

~ rival_waiting
if Story.flag("rival_1_done")
	Rival: Don't look so pleased with yourself.
else
	Rival: Well? Are we doing this?
=> END
